  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "酸雨"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>郭欣怡</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">落毛毛仔雨ê棑仔頭</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一隻一隻　輕輕仔跳bàn-bòo ê船</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hit个身軀勇壯tng飽水ê少年家</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tuè海湧起起落落ê板嘹</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">順勢kā厚重ê麻袋　幌起去肩胛頭</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">風　吹過少年家ê面</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">帶走--ê　是汗水</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Iah是</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">經過千百年轉世</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">tsiah見著少年家一面ê hit滴雨水</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">伊由在tsit个世間ê hua̍t-lo̍h</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄敢對少年家　開</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">真緊ē-tàng koh再sio見ê菝仔票</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就算án-ne</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心肝內ê ǹg望　猶原是</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">thìng候少年家放工ê時</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hām伊ê臭汗酸味　鬥陣tńg--去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無koh漂浪　無koh心酸</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgYh9ZG_F6QPwt3b-8JDAJPvK11SfGXGMWTKp7V2QuveBni_DLyxyTLnR21jrUYDx1pqbeWpW9uqDRYrtvBGhmvr1NesBQJuwvAtv8Vj4WdhJo-ci2k3yWORrIFwEzUMXLzaET4tDMP_0TRaw4Lk5uO_Xrbr4wagi2SmiYf92PQc1IqfhChO1altQb5CQ/s1424/346%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgYh9ZG_F6QPwt3b-8JDAJPvK11SfGXGMWTKp7V2QuveBni_DLyxyTLnR21jrUYDx1pqbeWpW9uqDRYrtvBGhmvr1NesBQJuwvAtv8Vj4WdhJo-ci2k3yWORrIFwEzUMXLzaET4tDMP_0TRaw4Lk5uO_Xrbr4wagi2SmiYf92PQc1IqfhChO1altQb5CQ/w450-h640/346%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEimU7VXFocR4eS12GeD8Z84JhzchaRl6u_dQB0Wp5qfDVyDrjjV3pjNEX5BuJFvDC6c4_ieitN0xOn37-IJcIxLJ6UW-1ykMCK75fiVmYfsStIx82XkPVoBRn0nopnOmSh9cALfmHYWWTq0TT2bac-cgBTIJEmV4TeQIuo664ZCqH6AZ6lhsMSJTN92dw/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1346%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8101.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img bord